{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026YWOyaLvUbd1794440469.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>日本最大券商野村控股，據報正研究出售加密貨幣業務。</p><p></p><p>《彭博》報道，野村旗下從事加密貨幣業務的Laser Digital，去年因為加密貨幣市場劇烈波動，出現重大虧損，令野村有意出售這家總部位於瑞士蘇黎世的附屬企業。潛在買家包括金融服務平台Marex集團，目前未有任何最終決定，意味交易最終可能不會進行。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T00:46:41.888217+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":150,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T23:40:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T22:57:36.372854+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T00:39:58.652257+00:00","content_hash":"013664520a0fd6ea7773303d447486c62546a29c0af62571ddcf923c8d6fbf21","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-12T00:46:41.888217+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}